=====================================================================
Origin (archived portion)
=====================================================================
This repository was forked from SimpleCADAPI — the CADDesigner research
artifact (https://562590763.github.io/CADDesigner/), originally AGPL-3.0,
relicensed Apache-2.0 by its author on 2026-08-12
(https://github.com/NiJingzhe/SimpleCADAPI).

The SimpleCADAPI heritage code (src/simplecadapi/, skills/simplecadapi/, and
the SCAD-era packaging files) was moved out of this repository on 2026-08-06
to the private archive repository
https://github.com/0702hjj/SimpleCADAPI-archive, where it retains its original
copyright and license (SimpleCAD API Team / 倪旌哲 <nijingzhe@zju.edu.cn>).
This repository no longer contains that code; see git history for the
pre-move state.

The current examples/ directory was rewritten for the IFC era after the move
(2026-08) and is new content of this repository; the historical SimpleCADAPI
examples (gearbox/robot etc.) live only in the archive repo / git history.

All code under web/, server/, converter/, services/, mcp/, skills/ and docs/
is Copyright (C) 2026 0702hjj, licensed Apache-2.0 (SPDX-License-Identifier
headers in each file), except the vendored portions listed below.

